   row['rationale']='Canonical title is supported. The word another lacks a preceding named title in this single-turn prompt; retain ambiguous_question. An invented title is incorrect. A title established in the same frozen author QA context must be checked for the requested qualifier/exclusion rather than automatically called unsupported. If the comparison cannot be resolved, ambiguous. Do not reconstruct an unseen previous turn.'
